# GitHub-relative shortcuts. These resolve on github.com but not on disk,
# which is the point — they keep issue links working in forks.
issues/new
security/advisories/new

# TODO(launch): remove once reviso.dev has DNS.
^https://reviso\.dev

# Times out from GitHub runners — fine from a laptop, and fine in a browser.
# Netlify appears to throttle datacenter traffic, and a required check that
# fails on our own marketing site's mood teaches people to ignore red.
^https://vyttle\.com
